: FPL 2026/27 tips, player picks, team ideas and strategy for the new season, mixed with a behind-the-scenes vlog of what we got up to together in Brighton. 🌊⚽️\n\nWho are Az, Yelena, Lee and Sam backing for GW1? Which players are causing the biggest debates? And did anyone actually manage to agree on their FPL team?! 😂\n\nLet us know in the comments: WHO is your must-have FPL player for 2026/27? 👇\n\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #FPL2026 #FPLTips #FPLFamily","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":694,"length":4,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPcBENzXBBgKIhMIjdfPi_KrlgMVYUnyAB3y3xd4ygEEM9gjbA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/fpl","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"FEhashtag","params":"6gUHCgNmcGwYAQ%3D%3D"}}},"loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CPcBENzXBBgKIhMIjdfPi_KrlgMVYUnyAB3y3xd4"}},{"startIndex":699,"length":21,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPYBENzXBBgLIhMIjdfPi_KrlgMVYUnyAB3y3xd4ygEEM9gjbA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/fantasypremierleague","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"FEhashtag","params":"6gUYChRmYW50YXN5cHJlbWllcmxlYWd1ZRgB"}}},"loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CPYBENzXBBgLIhMIjdfPi_KrlgMVYUnyAB3y3xd4"}},{"startIndex":721,"length":8,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPUBENzXBBgMIhMIjdfPi_KrlgMVYUnyAB3y3xd4ygEEM9gjbA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/fpl2026","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"FEhashtag","params":"6gULCgdmcGwyMDI2GAE%3D"}}},"loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CPUBENzXBBgMIhMIjdfPi_KrlgMVYUnyAB3y3xd4"}},{"startIndex":730,"length":8,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPQBENzXBBgNIhMIjdfPi_KrlgMVYUnyAB3y3xd4ygEEM9gjbA==","commandMetadata":{"webComma